      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Sebastian Cossa is suddenly saving Utah’s season. Here’s what he’s doing differently now Story by @houston_brogan https://t.co/HW7OlcWffe",
      "quoted_author": "Deseret News Sports",
      "quoted_handle": "DeseretSports"
    },
    {
      "id": "2124389905598210465",
      "text": "On a very special night, the Mammoth managed to shut down a very good Ducks offense and win with only 12 shots on net. Here's how they pulled off a very unlikely victory. #TusksUp https://t.co/3UohAnyoQ7",
      "url": "https://x.com/ChaseBeardsley_/status/2124389905598210465",
      "published": "2026-11-22T06:29:57+00:00",
      "likes": 11,
      "author": "Chase Beardsley",
      "handle": "ChaseBeardsley_",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1807334513242202112/cZn355NH_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2124387669623075249",
      "text": "After standing on his head in back-to-back victories, Cossa has done more than enough to earn the crease. Until further notice, the net belongs to the rookie. More here ⬇️ https://t.co/z3hoE9pRQJ",
