    {
      "id": "2124378735864582585",
      "text": "Postgame Notes - 11/21 vs. ANA: – Sebastian Cossa (29/31) joined Jesper Wallstedt (MIN, 11/14 at BOS) as the second goaltender to record a win on his birthday in 2026-27. – Utah's 12 shots on goal tonight were the fewest by any team in a win since 3/22/25 (NYR, 12 SOG vs. VAN). https://t.co/eXGLD6yKkA",
      "url": "https://x.com/UtahMammoth_PR/status/2124378735864582585",
      "published": "2026-11-22T05:45:34+00:00",
      "likes": 29,
      "author": "Utah Mammoth PR",
      "handle": "UtahMammoth_PR",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1920519937099001856/QeNWwde8_normal.jpg",
      "media": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXtPKwlasAAKsTq.png",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2124376651370999929",
      "text": "POSTGAME \"Really good win. Hard game, energy-wise. I think our guys battled really hard. We had good goaltending. Best power play in the league on the other side, and the PK (Penalty Kill) was clutch at key moments.\" @utahmammoth André Tourigny on tonight's win https://t.co/4NP7vRalT0",
      "url": "https://x.com/UtahMammoth_PR/status/2124376651370999929",
      "published": "2026-11-22T05:37:17+00:00",
      "likes": 27,
      "author": "Utah Mammoth PR",
